ollow the instructions below to bypass the warning:\r\n\r\n- **macOS**: Refer to [this guide](https://support.apple.com/en-gb/guide/mac-help/mh40616/15.0/mac/15.0) on how to open apps from unidentified developers.\r\n- **Windows**: Click 'More info' and then 'Run anyway' to continue.\r\n\r\n> **Note:** The Linux version has not been tested. If you try it out, please let us know how it works by opening an issue or submitting feedback!","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/steineggerlab/Metabuli-App/releases/176324386/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}}]